== Usage ==
Upon reaching {{Green|30}} bonus {{Stat|Farming Wisdom}}, '''Not Very Moldy Bread''' evolves into '''Very Moldy Bread''' with the following message:

{{Dialogue|&d&lEVOLUTION! &dYour &9Not Very Moldy Bread &dhas evolved!}}

Consuming '''Very Moldy Bread''' grants {{Stat|farming wisdom|+30}} for {{Green|60m}}, as well as a permanent {{stat|farming wisdom|+1}}. The permanent buff can only be gained {{Green|5}} times.

It gains {{Stat|farming wisdom|+0.1}} every {{Green|1h}}, taking {{Green|300h}} to reach the maximum buff of {{Green|+30}} bonus {{Stat|Farming Wisdom}}.
